    - 1944
    - 1947
    correctAnswerIndex: 3
    pointsReward: 10
  - questionText: "Chi\u1EBFn th\u1EAFng \u0110i\u1EC7n Bi\xEAn Ph\u1EE7 di\u1EC5n
      ra n\u0103m n\xE0o?"
    answers:
    - 1945
    - 1954
    - 1944
    - 1947
    correctAnswerIndex: 1
    pointsReward: 10
  - questionText: "Hi\u1EC7p \u0111\u1ECBnh Gen\xE8ve \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xFD khi
      n\xE0o?"
    answers:
    - 1945
    - 1954
    - 1944
    - 1947
    correctAnswerIndex: 1
    pointsReward: 10
  - questionText: "\u0110\u1EA3ng Lao \u0111\u1ED9ng Vi\u1EC7t Nam th\xE0nh l\u1EADp
      n\u0103m n\xE0o?"
    answers:
    - 1945
